          "description": "We are Looking for a motivated and detail-oriented Associate Software Engineer to join our development team in Islamabad. This role is ideal for fresh graduates or candidates with 0-2 years of experience who are eager to build scalable applications and grow in a fast-paced environment.\nCore Responsibilities\nAssist in designing, developing, and maintaining software applications\nWrite clean, efficient, and well-documented code\nDebug and troubleshoot software issues\nParticipate in code reviews and team meetings\nCollaborate with cross-functional teams (QA, Product, DevOps)\nLearn and implement best coding practices\nSupport deployment and post-release monitoring\nRequirements\nBachelor's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or related field\nStrong understanding of programming fundamentals (OOP, Data Structures)\nKnowledge of at least one programming language (e.g., Python, Java, JavaScript, C#)\nBasic understanding of databases (SQL / NoSQL)\nFamiliarity with Git/version control\nGood problem-solving and analytical skills\nStrong communication skills\nPreferred (Nice to Have):\nInternship or project experience\nUnderstanding of REST APIs\nExposure to cloud platforms (AWS, Azure, GCP)\nKnowledge of Agile methodologies",
